#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3512
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Characters in a Space can spar with each other: press Space (or the pad's sword button) next to another standing character to land a hit. Each hit deals damage and shows a small health bar under their name; at zero HP the character is knocked down for a few seconds, then gets back up on their own with full health. Sitting characters are out of combat, and a knockout never has any lasting effect — it is all in good fun."
msgstr ""
"Karakter dalam ruang angkasa dapat berlatih satu sama lain: tekan spasi "
"(atau tombol pedang pad) di samping karakter berdiri lain untuk mendaratkan "
"pukulan. Masing-masing mencapai kesepakatan kerusakan dan menunjukkan sebuah"
" bar kesehatan kecil di bawah nama mereka; di nol HP karakter diturunkan "
"untuk beberapa detik, kemudian kembali pada mereka sendiri dengan kesehatan "
"penuh. Sat characters are out of battle, and a knockout never have any "
"lasting effect - it is all in good."

