"terhubung."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/commands.ex:338
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Invite someone to a P2P session that runs an audio/video call, file transfers, and games together over one connection. The request arrives in the private message and the PM header shows Join/Decline — accepting it starts the session right there, with the P2P Session Console opening on the chat desktop. See also: P2P Sessions in Chat, P2P Session."
msgstr ""
"Undang seseorang untuk sesi P2P yang menjalankan panggilan audio/video, "
"transfer file, dan permainan bersama-sama melalui satu koneksi. Permintaan "
"tiba dalam pesan pribadi dan kepala PM menunjukkan Join/Decline - "
"menerimanya dimulai sesi di sana, dengan P2P Sesi Console membuka pada "
"desktop percakapan. Lihat juga: Sesi P2P dalam Sesi Chat, P2P."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1048
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Make video calls with camera controls, picture-in-picture, and quality settings. See also: P2P Session."
msgstr ""
"Membuat panggilan video dengan kendali kamera, gambar-in-gambar, dan "
"pengaturan kualitas. Lihat juga: sesi P2P."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1116
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "P2P Session"
msgstr "Sesi P2P"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1161
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Run a P2P session without leaving the chat: /p2p <nick> opens setup, shows the creator's P2P Session Console immediately, and sends a request line into the private message. The invited person's PM tab opens in the background with Join/Decline in the PM header. Once connected, the P2P menu (also mirrored in the Start menu) opens the P2P Session Console on the chat desktop with Call, Files, Games and Stats sections. The conversation IS the private message — session events (connected, file received, game results, who ended it) are saved into the PM history as P2P lines, and the PM tab shows a small P2P icon while the session is live. The status bar always shows the active session: click it to bring the P2P Session Console to the front, or use its stop button to cancel a pending invite / end the session. You can hold ONE session at a time — accepting a new invite (or inviting someone else) asks to end the current session first. When a TURN relay is configured, Toggle Privacy Mode in the P2P menu forces the connection through the relay so your IP address is never shared with the peer. See also: P2P Session, Video Call, File Transfer, Private Messages."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan sesi P2P tanpa meninggalkan percakapan: /p2p <nick> membuka setup, "
"menunjukkan Konsol Sesi P2P pencipta segera, dan mengirim baris permintaan "
"ke pesan pribadi. Tab PM orang diundang dibuka di latar belakang dengan "
"JoinX/Decline di kepala PM. Setelah tersambung, menu P2P (juga dicermin di "
"menu Start) membuka Konsol Sesi P2P pada desktop obrolan dengan Bagian Call,"
" Files, Games dan Stats. Percakapan ini adalah pesan pribadi - acara sesi "
"(tersambung, diterima berkas, hasil permainan, yang mengakhirinya) disimpan "
"ke dalam sejarah PM sebagai baris P2P, dan tab PM menampilkan sebuah ikon "
"P2P kecil ketika sesi hidup. Batang status selalu menampilkan sesi aktif: "
"klik itu untuk membawa Konsol Sesi P2P ke depan, atau gunakan tombol stop "
"untuk membatalkan undangan tertunda / mengakhiri sesi. Anda dapat mengadakan"
" SATU sesi pada satu waktu - menerima undangan baru (atau mengundang orang "
"lain) meminta untuk mengakhiri sesi saat ini terlebih dahulu. Ketika relay "
"TURN dikonfigurasi, Jungkitkan Mode Privasi dalam menu P2P memaksa koneksi "
"melalui relay sehingga alamat IP Anda tidak pernah dibagikan kepada peer. "
"Lihat juga: Sesi P2P, Video Call, Transfer File, Pesan Pribadi."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1246
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Send files directly to other users via peer-to-peer with drag-and-drop support. See also: P2P Session."
msgstr ""
"Kirim berkas langsung ke pengguna lain melalui peer-to -peer dengan drag "
"-and-drop dukungan. Lihat juga: sesi P2P."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:585
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Session Cards and P2P History"
msgstr "Kartu Sesi dan Riwayat P2P"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1131
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The P2P Session is the persistent peer-to-peer connection behind /p2p — one link that hosts a call, file transfers and games all at the same time. It lives inside the chat: accepting an invite opens the P2P Session Console right on the chat desktop, and ending any one activity never drops the others. See also: P2P Sessions in Chat."
msgstr ""
"Sesi P2P adalah koneksi persisten peerto-peer di belakang /p2p - satu link "
"yang host panggilan, transfer file dan permainan semua pada saat yang sama. "
"Ia tinggal di dalam percakapan: menerima undangan membuka Konsol Sesi P2P "
"tepat di desktop obrolan, dan mengakhiri aktivitas apapun tidak pernah "
"menjatuhkan yang lain. Lihat juga: sesi P2P dalam Percakapan."

