#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/commands.ex:654
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "except admin roles, audit logs, server bans, and server settings; registration is reopened for recovery. "
msgstr ""
"kecuali peran admin, log audit, server bans, dan pengaturan server; "
"registrasi dibuka kembali untuk pemulihan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:73
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The chat runs on a Windows-style desktop: the chat itself is one pinned window (maximized by default) that you can restore, drag and resize, over a taskbar with a Start menu and a tray clock. Window layout persists across visits. The window, its taskbar button and the browser tab are all named after the conversation you are in. "
msgstr ""
"Obrolan yang dijalankan pada desktop bergaya Windows-: Percakapan itu "
"sendiri adalah salah satu jendela yang disematkan (dimaksimalkan secara "
"baku) yang dapat dikembalikan, seret dan ubah ukuran, melalui batang taskbar"
" dengan menu awal dan jam baki. Tata letak jendela berlanjut di seluruh "
"kunjungan. Jendela, tombol taskbar-nya, dan tab peramban semuanya dinamai "
"sesuai percakapan yang sedang Anda buka. "

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:919
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Bar showing your live session: active call or P2P session, online buddies, lag indicator, clock, and mute state. Who you are and what you are reading are named in the chat window's title bar."
msgstr ""
"Bilah yang menampilkan sesi Anda saat ini: panggilan atau sesi P2P aktif, "
"teman yang online, indikator lag, jam, dan status suara. Siapa Anda dan apa "
"yang sedang Anda baca tertulis di bilah judul jendela obrolan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:823
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "account history"
msgstr "riwayat akun"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:191
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Attach uploaded files to channel and private messages, then download them through authorized links."
msgstr ""
"Lampirkan berkas yang diunggah ke saluran dan pesan pribadi, kemudian unduh "
"mereka melalui link yang berwenang."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/text_formatting.ex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Choose whether new messages are sent as IRC formatting, Markdown, or plain text."
msgstr ""
"Pilih apakah pesan baru dikirim sebagai format IRC, Markdown, atau teks "
"biasa."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/text_formatting.ex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Format your messages with IRC controls, Markdown, or plain text."
msgstr "Format pesan Anda dengan kendali IRC, Markdown, atau teks biasa."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:180
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Message Attachments"
msgstr "Lampiran pesan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/text_formatting.ex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Message Formats"
msgstr "Format pesan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:104
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "On a phone the desktop stacks: one window fills the screen at a time and the taskbar switches between them — the same strip of window buttons as on a desktop, squeezed to fit and scrolled when crowded. The conversations and user list keep no column of their own there: the first two buttons of the conversation toolbar slide each one open over the chat, so every message and the message box run the full width of the screen. The Start menu opens one level at a time: tapping a group replaces the list with its entries, and the group's own row at the top takes you back."
msgstr ""
"Di telepon, tumpukan desktop: satu jendela mengisi layar sekaligus dan "
"tombol taskbar di antaranya - sama dengan tombol-tombol jendela seperti pada"
" desktop, diperas agar sesuai dan digulung ketika ramai. Percakapan dan "
"daftar pengguna tidak memiliki kolom sendiri di sana: dua tombol pertama "
"pada bilah alat percakapan membuka masing-masing di atas obrolan, sehingga "
"setiap pesan dan kotak pesan memakai seluruh lebar layar. Menu awal membuka "
"satu tingkat pada suatu waktu: menyadap sebuah grup menggantikan daftar "
"dengan entri, dan baris grup sendiri di bagian atas membawa Anda kembali."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:183
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "attachments"
msgstr "lampiran"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:186
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "download"
msgstr "unduh"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:184
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "files"
msgstr "berkas"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:187
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "signed URL"
msgstr "URL bertanda tangan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:185
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "upload"
msgstr "unggah"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:158
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Entries you cannot use right now are grayed out rather than hidden. Opening Start ▸ Tools from the landing page shows Address Book, Notify List and the rest in gray: they are real parts of the app, waiting for you to connect. The menu is the same map wherever you are standing on it."
msgstr ""
"Entri yang tidak dapat Anda gunakan saat ini terukir keluar daripada "
"tersembunyi. Membuka Piranti Awal dari halaman pendaratan menunjukkan Buku "
"Alamat, Daftar Beritahu, dan lainnya dalam abu-abu: mereka adalah bagian "
"nyata dari aplikasi, menunggu Anda untuk terhubung. Menu adalah peta yang "
"sama dimanapun Anda berdiri di atasnya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:155
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Link Previews"
msgstr "pratinjau link"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:181
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "On a desktop a group flies out beside the menu and hovering another group switches to it. On a phone the menu drills down instead: tapping a group replaces the list with its entries and the group's own row at the top takes you back."
msgstr ""
"Pada desktop kelompok terbang di samping menu dan melayang kelompok lain "
"switch ke dalamnya. Di telepon, menu mengebor turun: menyadap sebuah grup "
"menggantikan daftar dengan entri dan baris grup sendiri di bagian atas "
"membawa Anda kembali."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:463
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "System Windows"
msgstr "Jendela Sistem"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:128
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Start Menu"
msgstr "Menu Awal"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:151
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Start button opens the same menu on every screen RetroHexChat has — the landing pages, the Connect screen, the chat, this Help viewer and the design system. What changes between them is which entries are live."
msgstr ""
"Tombol Start membuka menu yang sama pada setiap layar RetroHexChat memiliki "
"- halaman pendaratan, layar koneksi, obrolan, Penilik Bantuan ini dan sistem"
" desain. Apa yang berubah antara mereka adalah entri mana yang hidup."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:147
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "View and manage URLs shared across all channels with standards-based link previews."
msgstr ""
"Lihat dan kelola URL yang dibagikan di semua kanal dengan pratilik link."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:516
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every window that shows rows shares one table: resize its columns, choose which ones show, order by any of them, and copy what you select."
msgstr ""
"Setiap jendela yang menampilkan baris berbagi satu tabel: ubah ukuran kolom,"
" pilih yang mana yang ditampilkan, urut oleh salah satunya, dan salin apa "
"yang Anda pilih."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:498
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Listings & Tables"
msgstr "Daftar dan tabel"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:490
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Thirteen admin-only windows that read the running server: its memory, processes, connections, database, Oban jobs and live metrics."
msgstr ""
"Tiga belas admin - hanya jendela yang membaca server yang berjalan: memori, "
"proses, koneksi, database, Oban pekerjaan dan metrik hidup."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:510
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
