msgstr "urutkan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:509
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "table"
msgstr "tabel"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Connect Window"
msgstr "Hubungkan Jendela"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:37
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Sign in from the Connect window, which appears both on its own screen and on every public page. It carries the whole flow: pick a nickname, register a new one or enter a password for a registered one, and choose whether to remember the terminal. A remembered terminal signs you in with a single click, and one set to auto-login takes you straight to the chat."
msgstr ""
"Masuk dari jendela Sambung, yang muncul baik pada layar sendiri dan di "
"setiap halaman publik. Ini membawa seluruh aliran: pilih nama panggilan, "
"daftarkan yang baru atau masukkan sandi untuk yang terdaftar, dan pilih "
"apakah akan mengingat terminal. Sebuah terminal yang mengingat tanda-tanda "
"Anda dengan klik tunggal, dan satu set ke auto- login membawa Anda langsung "
"ke chat."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:577
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Clickable nicknames, channels, and URLs, with hover cards and a preview card under any message carrying a link."
msgstr ""
"Nama panggilan, saluran, dan URL, dengan kartu hover dan kartu pratilik di "
"bawah pesan apapun yang membawa link."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics.ex:61
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics.ex:91
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1580
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1581
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Retro Games"
msgstr "Game Retro"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1583
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "retro games"
msgstr "game retro"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1637
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Play browser-native RetroHexChat games solo against AI inside the chat desktop. Hex Pong, Light Trails, Star Duel variants, Block Breakers, Hex Warlords, Hex Raid variants, Hex Outlaw variants, Hex Tennis variants, Hex Invaders variants, Hex Enduro variants, Hex Skiing variants, Hex Frost variants, and Hex Hockey variants are available."
msgstr ""
"Mainkan game RetroHexChat native browser secara solo melawan AI di desktop "
"chat. Hex Pong, Light Trails, varian Star Duel, Block Breakers, Hex "
"Warlords, varian Hex Raid, varian Hex Outlaw, varian Hex Tennis, varian Hex "
"Invaders, varian Hex Enduro, varian Hex Skiing, varian Hex Frost, dan varian"
" Hex Hockey tersedia."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1642
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hex Boxing is also available."
msgstr "Hex Boxing juga tersedia."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1722
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It is also available in Retro Games solo mode against an AI tank."
msgstr "Game ini juga tersedia di mode solo Game Retro melawan tank AI."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1643
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Pixel Tanks is also available."
msgstr "Pixel Tanks juga tersedia."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2910
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Play classic point & click adventures in your browser — "
msgstr "Mainkan petualangan point & click klasik di browser Anda — "

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2755
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2788
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2858
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Powered by"
msgstr "Didukung oleh"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2654
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2914
